cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "DIFS: Discriminative Feature Selection for single-cell RNA-seq clustering"
abstract: >-
  DIFS selects genes for single-cell RNA-seq clustering in two stages: a dip
  statistic calibrated against a Gaussian reference ranks genes that are
  multimodal among expressing cells, and a Fisher exact test against a
  preliminary clustering adds features associated with the preliminary clusters.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/KunLiu21/DIFS"
authors:
